@startuml
title Factory Method: создание абонемента (Вариант 8)

interface Pass {
  +description() : String
  +price() : double
}

interface PassCreator {
  +createPass() : Pass
}

class WeekendPass
class MonthlyPass
class StudentPass
class SchoolPass

class WeekendPassCreator
class MonthlyPassCreator
class StudentPassCreator
class SchoolPassCreator

PassCreator <|.. WeekendPassCreator
PassCreator <|.. MonthlyPassCreator
PassCreator <|.. StudentPassCreator
PassCreator <|.. SchoolPassCreator

WeekendPassCreator ..> WeekendPass : создаёт
MonthlyPassCreator ..> MonthlyPass : создаёт
StudentPassCreator ..> StudentPass : создаёт
SchoolPassCreator ..> SchoolPass : создаёт

Pass <|.. WeekendPass
Pass <|.. MonthlyPass
Pass <|.. StudentPass
Pass <|.. SchoolPass
@enduml
